<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-AUSTRALIAN PGA FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-AUSTRALIAN PGA FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading final round scores and</p>
<p>totals in the Australian PGA championship at the par-72 New</p>
<p>South Wales course on Sunday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>279 Phillip Tataurangi (New Zealand) 71 72 69 67</p>
<p>280 Rodger Davis 71 73 69 67, Peter Lonard 69 69 72 70</p>
<p>282 Wayne Smith 66 77 70 69, Anthony Painter 71 69 71 71, Chris</p>
