<p>	 Long (New Zealand) 70 75 69 72, Paul Gow 76 68 69 73</p>
<p>287 Robin Byrd (U.S.) 68 72 79 68, Wayne Grady 72 74 71 70,</p>
<p>	 David Howell (Britain) 73 70 74 70, Stuart Appleby 74 73</p>
<p>69 71,</p>
<p>	 Steve Alker (New Zealand) 71 71 73 72, Justin Cooper 70</p>
<p>68 73</p>
<p>	 76, Jerry Kelly (U.S.) 73 66 71 77.</p>
